# The prototype lives on the `spike/mixer-two-pane` branch, not here. It may still
# exist in this working tree because the installed profile links to it
# (`~/.dsh/profiles/web/node_modules/dsh-mixer-spike -> <repo>/spike`): deleting the
# directory would leave that link dangling until `dsh-mixer-spike` is uninstalled.
# Never commit it on this branch.
spike/
